WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.138
Episode eight: a failure that never reaches the server.

2
00:00:03.138 --> 00:00:06.220
The reviewer rejects the report, but forgets the note.

3
00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:11.156
The reviewer opens the reviewer view, leaves the note empty, and presses Reject.

4
00:00:11.508 --> 00:00:15.058
The note box is outlined in red, and the cursor is put in it.

5
00:00:15.058 --> 00:00:16.570
The status did not change.

6
00:00:16.922 --> 00:00:19.810
Reject lists reviewerNote as a required field.

7
00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.510
It is empty, so missingNames has one entry.

8
00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:23.640
The check is true.

9
00:00:23.991 --> 00:00:26.913
Each missing field is told to mark itself invalid.

10
00:00:26.913 --> 00:00:28.433
That adds the red outline.

11
00:00:28.433 --> 00:00:32.290
As soon as someone types in it, refresh removes the outline again.

12
00:00:32.641 --> 00:00:36.749
The first missing field gets the focus, and the function returns false.

13
00:00:36.749 --> 00:00:39.353
Look at the watch: the status is still draft.

14
00:00:39.353 --> 00:00:43.288
It returned before the status changed, and before anything was sent.

15
00:00:43.638 --> 00:00:45.751
With a note, the same button works.

16
00:00:45.751 --> 00:00:48.830
The status becomes rejected, and the note is shown.

17
00:00:51.963 --> 00:00:54.258
To try this yourself, open sample.

18
00:00:54.258 --> 00:00:59.052
html, open DevTools, and set the same breakpoints in the Sources panel.

19
00:00:59.052 --> 00:01:01.820
Then do what we did, and step through it.
